"get this to Ensign Fargalli in time. %s"
msgstr ""
"We have transmitted all of our current research on the Omicron plague "
"including treatment fabrication instructions. We have also transported what "
"we believe will cure any victims of the plague along with unique raw "
"materials required to manufacture more of the treatment. I hope you are able "
"get this to Ensign Fargalli in time. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5926
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Take return transit from %s to %s"
msgstr "Take return transit from %s to %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5936
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Thanks for your help"
msgstr "Thanks for your help"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5941
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5972
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Back"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5953
msgctxt "mission2ndBis-comms"
msgid "Give medical treatment and research to sickbay"
msgstr "Give medical treatment and research to sickbay"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5960
msgctxt "mission2ndBis-comms"
msgid ""
"Treatment received. Fargalli is expected to live. We are beginning to "
"conduct in depth analysis of the research material with an eye to prevention "
"of future infection."
msgstr ""
"Treatment received. Fargalli is expected to live. We are beginning to "
"conduct in depth analysis of the research material with an eye to prevention "
"of future infection."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5968
msgctxt "mission2ndBis-comms"
msgid "The medical research and treatment is not aboard your ship"
msgstr "The medical research and treatment is not aboard your ship"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:5985
#, lua-format
msgctxt "orders-comms"
msgid ""
"\n"
"   %i Minutes remain in game"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   %i Minutes remain in game"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6027
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What kind of information do you need?"
msgstr "What kind of information do you need?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6052
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"After treating Ensign Fargalli, we took a closer look at the accompanying "
"research. Analysis of the research material, the telemetry from your ship, "
"and recent reports from intelligence brings us to an ominous conclusion."
msgstr ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"After treating Ensign Fargalli, we took a closer look at the accompanying "
"research. Analysis of the research material, the telemetry from your ship, "
"and recent reports from intelligence brings us to an ominous conclusion."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6058
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What have you concluded?"
msgstr "What have you concluded?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6062
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Fargalli's illness and the previous similar cases experienced were not "
"accidental. They were deliberately infected."
msgstr ""
"Fargalli's illness and the previous similar cases experienced were not "
"accidental. They were deliberately infected."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6066
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What? Who infected them?"
msgstr "What? Who infected them?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6071
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari. Fargalli and others are apparently the victims of a preliminary "
"experimental biological attack. The Exuari have code named this biological "
"agent Omicron after the early 21st century pandemic virus variant on Earth "
"which was highly contagious."
msgstr ""
"The Exuari. Fargalli and others are apparently the victims of a preliminary "
"experimental biological attack. The Exuari have code named this biological "
"agent Omicron after the early 21st century pandemic virus variant on Earth "
"which was highly contagious."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6077
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "That's sobering. Do we have more information?"
msgstr "That's sobering. Do we have more information?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6083
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Indeed we do. It looks like Omicron might be transmitted via subspace. We "
"believe the Exuari plan to 'broadcast' Omicron to every known human "
"location. Needless to say, this would have extinction level consequences."
msgstr ""
"Indeed we do. It looks like Omicron might be transmitted via subspace. We "
"believe the Exuari plan to 'broadcast' Omicron to every known human "
"location. Needless to say, this would have extinction level consequences."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6089
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Ouch. Is there a planned response?"
msgstr "Ouch. Is there a planned response?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6095
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Destruction of the Exuari Omicron production and broadcast facility is the "
"best thing we can think of."
msgstr ""
"Destruction of the Exuari Omicron production and broadcast facility is the "
"best thing we can think of."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6099
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "Can we help?"
msgstr "Can we help?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6104
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"We hope that you can. We don't know the precise location of the Exuari "
"facility, just a general direction. However, when we examined the telemetry "
"from your science officer's console when you were near the independent "
"medical research facility, we noticed something interesting."
msgstr ""
"We hope that you can. We don't know the precise location of the Exuari "
"facility, just a general direction. However, when we examined the telemetry "
"from your science officer's console when you were near the independent "
"medical research facility, we noticed something interesting."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6110
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "What did you notice?"
msgstr "What did you notice?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6116
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"The entity used to produce the treatment is also likely to be used to create "
"Omicron. It gives off a powerful bio-signature that is periodic in nature, "
"vaguely resembling a heartbeat."
msgstr ""
"The entity used to produce the treatment is also likely to be used to create "
"Omicron. It gives off a powerful bio-signature that is periodic in nature, "
"vaguely resembling a heartbeat."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6122
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid "This signature can identify the Exuari Omicron facility?"
msgstr "This signature can identify the Exuari Omicron facility?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6129
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission4th-comms"
msgid ""
"Yes, but if you're unsure, you are authorized to destroy every Exuari "
"facility. You will need to travel into Exuari infested space along bearing "
"%i from station %s to find the Omicron facility and destroy it. Our best "
"intelligence estimates that deployment will occur within the next %i "
"minutes. Happy hunting!"
msgstr ""
"Yes, but if you're unsure, you are authorised to destroy every Exuari "
"facility. You will need to travel into Exuari infested space along bearing "
"%i from station %s to find the Omicron facility and destroy it. Our best "
"intelligence estimates that deployment will occur within the next %i "
"minutes. Happy hunting!"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6157
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"To %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Ensign Fargalli, one of the maintenance engineers aboard the freighter %s, "
"just reported to sickbay here on %s. We can treat his symptoms, but don't "
"have a treatment for the root cause of his illness. This is the third case "
"of this type we've seen in the last week. The last two ended up being fatal."
msgstr ""
"To %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Ensign Fargalli, one of the maintenance engineers aboard the freighter %s, "
"just reported to sickbay here on %s. We can treat his symptoms, but don't "
"have a treatment for the root cause of his illness. This is the third case "
"of this type we've seen in the last week. The last two ended up being fatal."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6166
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Why are you telling me this?"
msgstr "Why are you telling me this?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6172
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We've received word that Independent station %s is conducting ongoing "
"research into this malady and may have more information, maybe even a remedy."
msgstr ""
"We've received word that Independent station %s is conducting ongoing "
"research into this malady and may have more information, maybe even a remedy."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6181
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Then you should get that treatment from %s to save Fargalli"
msgstr "Then you should get that treatment from %s to save Fargalli"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6190
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We can't contact %s directly since they are not on our communications "
"network."
msgstr ""
"We can't contact %s directly since they are not on our communications "
"network."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6196
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "A courier could get it"
msgstr "A courier could get it"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6202
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"We tried sending couriers. All of our couriers were shot down. We are "
"telling you all this because we need you to go to %s and bring back any "
"medical research or treatment or medicine they may have"
msgstr ""
"We tried sending couriers. All of our couriers were shot down. We are "
"telling you all this because we need you to go to %s and bring back any "
"medical research or treatment or medicine they may have"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6208
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Now I understand"
msgstr "Now I understand"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6214
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"There is some urgency. Based on the previous cases, Fargalli has about %i "
"minutes to live"
msgstr ""
"There is some urgency. Based on the previous cases, Fargalli has about %i "
"minutes to live"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6223
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "Where is station %s?"
msgstr "Where is station %s?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6233
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid "%s is in sector %s. Good luck"
msgstr "%s is in sector %s. Good luck"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6244
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on an approximate bearing of %i from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""
"%s is on an approximate bearing of %i from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6269
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission2nd-comms"
msgid ""
"%s is on a precise bearing of %.1f from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."
msgstr ""
"%s is on a precise bearing of %.1f from %s. Distance is greater than %.1f "
"units."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6293
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Hello, %s"
msgstr ""
"To: %s\n"
"From: %s\n"
"\n"
"Hello, %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6301
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Hello, %s"
msgstr "Hello, %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6308
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"One of the commercial freighters just docked up and their personnel inferred "
"that you might be traveling in our direction."
msgstr ""
"One of the commercial freighters just docked up and their personnel inferred "
"that you might be travelling in our direction."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6312
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Those are well informed personnel"
msgstr "Those are well informed personnel"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6317
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"It's amazing what commercial freighters learn and how quickly they learn it."
msgstr ""
"It's amazing what commercial freighters learn and how quickly they learn it."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6323
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Indeed. Why are you contacting us?"
msgstr "Indeed. Why are you contacting us?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6329
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We were wondering how soon you might get here. You see, there's this group "
"of Exuari approaching and they don't look terribly friendly."
msgstr ""
"We were wondering how soon you might get here. You see, there's this group "
"of Exuari approaching and they don't look terribly friendly."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6335
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We intend to get medical research, not necessarily engage Exuari"
msgstr "We intend to get medical research, not necessarily engage Exuari"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6341
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We could make it worth your while if you were to protect our station from "
"these Exuari."
msgstr ""
"We could make it worth your while if you were to protect our station from "
"these Exuari."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6345
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "How so?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6350
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"If you were to destroy the attacking Exuari, we could offer you one of these:"
msgstr ""
"If you were to destroy the attacking Exuari, we could offer you one of these:"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6356
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% faster impulse speed"
msgstr "25% faster impulse speed"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6365
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6387
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6411
#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6436
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "You got it. We're in sector %s"
msgstr "You got it. We're in sector %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6376
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Rapid transit back to %s"
msgstr "Rapid transit back to %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6402
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "25% stronger beam weapons"
msgstr "25% stronger beam weapons"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6427
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Replenish all your ordnance"
msgstr "Replenish all your ordnance"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6449
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We just need to know where you are located"
msgstr "We just need to know where you are located"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6463
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We added paypoint %i to your system which identifies our station. We may or "
"may not be able to provide what you request depending on how busy we are "
"fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""
"We added paypoint %i to your system which identifies our station. We may or "
"may not be able to provide what you request depending on how busy we are "
"fighting off Exuari."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6473
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We are in sector %s. We may or may not be able to provide what you request "
"depending on how busy we are fighting off Exuari."
msgstr ""
"We are in sector %s. We may or may not be able to provide what you request "
"depending on how busy we are fighting off Exuari."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6486
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Sounds bad. Do you need help?"
msgstr "Sounds bad. Do you need help?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6492
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We welcome any help you might provide. It would facilitate our survival."
msgstr ""
"We welcome any help you might provide. It would facilitate our survival."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6498
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Could you provide us with your location?"
msgstr "Could you provide us with your location?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6505
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "You mean %s did not tell you where to find us?"
msgstr "You mean %s did not tell you where to find us?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6514
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They did, but we prefer greater precision"
msgstr "They did, but we prefer greater precision"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6527
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We added waypoint %i to your system for our station. Your timely arrival "
"would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""
"We added waypoint %i to your system for our station. Your timely arrival "
"would be greatly appreciated."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6539
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "%s provided a bearing, but we prefer greater precision"
msgstr "%s provided a bearing, but we prefer greater precision"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6548
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are in sector %s. Your timely arrival would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr "We are in sector %s. Your timely arrival would be greatly appreciated."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6565
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Your information is correct"
msgstr "Your information is correct"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6570
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "That's great news. We've got some pesky Exuari in the area."
msgstr "That's great news. We've got some pesky Exuari in the area."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6576
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Let me guess, you want our help with the Exuari?"
msgstr "Let me guess, you want our help with the Exuari?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6583
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Got it in one. We're in sector %s. Please don't dawdle"
msgstr "Got it in one. We're in sector %s. Please don't dawdle"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6591
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They're everywhere"
msgstr "They're everywhere"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6596
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"This batch is in our back yard. If you're going to be in the neighborhood "
"already, could you help us out?"
msgstr ""
"This batch is in our back yard. If you're going to be in the neighbourhood "
"already, could you help us out?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6600
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Sure"
msgstr "Sure"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6606
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Great. We're in sector %s"
msgstr "Great. We're in sector %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6618
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We're really only coming to get medical research"
msgstr "We're really only coming to get medical research"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6622
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "Understood."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6631
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Identify your sector and we'll help"
msgstr "Identify your sector and we'll help"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6638
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Fair enough. We're in sector %s"
msgstr "Fair enough. We're in sector %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6649
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We might be. Why do you ask?"
msgstr "We might be. Why do you ask?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6654
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"Well, we've observed some Exuari headed our way. We don't think they're "
"making a courtesy call"
msgstr ""
"Well, we've observed some Exuari headed our way. We don't think they're "
"making a courtesy call"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6660
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "They never do. Would you like our help?"
msgstr "They never do. Would you like our help?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6667
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Yes, please. We're in sector %s"
msgstr "Yes, please. We're in sector %s"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6676
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Where exactly is 'your way?'"
msgstr "Where exactly is 'your way?'"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6682
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Our station is located in sector %s. We hope to see you soon."
msgstr "Our station is located in sector %s. We hope to see you soon."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6692
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We'd like to help, but we're having a hard time finding you"
msgstr "We'd like to help, but we're having a hard time finding you"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6699
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We're in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari look dangerous."
msgstr "We're in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari look dangerous."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6710
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Technically, our mission does not cover protection from Exuari"
msgstr "Technically, our mission does not cover protection from Exuari"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6713
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Drat"
msgstr "Drat"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6720
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Where are you located?"
msgstr "Where are you located?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6725
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari are approaching."
msgstr "We are in sector %s. Please hurry, the Exuari are approaching."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6732
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We are glad you contacted us"
msgstr "We are glad you contacted us"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6737
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Coincidentally, we are glad to be in contact with you, too."
msgstr "Coincidentally, we are glad to be in contact with you, too."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6740
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "Why is that?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6745
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"We are in need of some assistance with Exuari that are approaching our "
"station, %s."
msgstr ""
"We are in need of some assistance with Exuari that are approaching our "
"station, %s."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6750
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "We can help"
msgstr "We can help"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6754
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "That's so good to hear. You may want to hurry, though."
msgstr "That's so good to hear. You may want to hurry, though."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6758
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid "Why the rush?"
msgstr "Why the rush?"

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6765
#, lua-format
msgctxt "mission3th-comms"
msgid ""
"The Exuari! They're getting closer! Please come to us in sector %s as soon "
"as you can."
msgstr ""
"The Exuari! They're getting closer! Please come to us in sector %s as soon "
"as you can."

#: scripts/scenario_43_the_omicron_plague.lua:6778
#, lua-format
